4. Use live() with options.now for expiry (pattern :1519-1530), world()/finishOne() for earlier agents and file contents, and the real parser for words.
5. Update the pinned assertions: history.test.mjs:97 and engine.test.mjs:1392, :2288, :425, :446, :451, :481.
